Package: opsec
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ckazros <officialckazros@gmail.com>
Depends: curl, wget, gnupg, apt-transport-https, ca-certificates, lsb-release, xz-utils, desktop-file-utils, ufw, iptables, macchanger, polkitd, pkexec
Description: Complete OpSec suite containing Mullvad VPN, Mullvad Browser, and Proton Mail.
 Installs the privacy tools plus the security hardening scripts (firewall,
 MAC randomization, sysctl hardening) and the opsec-launch launcher used by
 the opsecDE control center.
